<title>USA: San Francisco State Building Auth. $340 mln priced.</title>
<headline>San Francisco State Building Auth. $340 mln priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>BA Securities Inc said it priced $340 million of San Francisco State Building Authority lease revenue bonds, 1996 Series A, for the San Francisco Civic Center Complex, with a top yield of 5.59 percent in 2021.</p>
<p>BA Securities said it has the verbal award. Co-managers include JC Bradford &amp; Co and Morgan Stanley &amp; Co.</p>
<p>The bonds are AMBAC Insured.</p>
<p>MOODYS: Aaa/ Con. single-A; S&amp;P: AAA/single-A provisional;</p>
<p>FITCH: AAA/A-minus.</p>
<p>DATED: 12/01/1996, FIRST COUPON: 6/01/1997, DUE: 12/01</p>
